# Copy to .env (Expo loads EXPO_PUBLIC_* automatically).
# Leave empty during development: the app auto-detects your PC's LAN IP from the Expo dev server.
# Set it for: Android emulator (http://10.0.2.2:5000), a fixed LAN IP, or production (https://crm.yourdomain.com)
# Do NOT add /api at the end.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
